flavfinder-core
===============

This repository is an independent, code-only port of the original
"flavfinder" project. It does not include the original project's Git
history, training data, real MS/MS example spectra, or pretrained models.

Original project
----------------
Name:   flavfinder
URL:    https://github.com/Ficere/flavfinder
Author: Lvjun Guo (Ficere) <gljx898989@163.com>
Original HEAD at port time:
        2517ca4da6100a918418c7e06e5a98ae67d687ce

What is not included
--------------------
- train_datasets/ (P/N train and test CSV files)
- examples/infile.json, outfile.json, and other real spectra
- trained_models/ or any AutoGluon predictor / model weights

The original project and its reference checkout remain the authoritative
source for the data and the historical commits.

